#: 294040899584
msgid "survey1Intro"
msgstr ""
"Hey! The horse wants to clear something up.\n"
"\n"
"Just a couple of quick questions to figure out who she’s dealing with.\n"
"Won’t take more than a minute."

#: 384566562816
msgid "survey1Final"
